    "detailed_description": "CORR is a CHALLENGING Souls-lite Boss Rush Action RPG where you Run-n-Gun &amp; Hack-n-Dash your way through formidable boss encounters. To endure the strange, dark, and bizarre world of CORR, level up and customize your warrior build with berserk powers, tonics, talismans, and more.                                                                                                    <br>                                                                                                          <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330260/extras/2cd4b129441ca92a4e485f279914c6f2.poster.avif?t=1747400955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330260/extras/2cd4b129441ca92a4e485f279914c6f2.webm?t=1747400955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330260/extras/2cd4b129441ca92a4e485f279914c6f2.mp4?t=1747400955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>I-frame dashes.<br></li><li>Stamina/energy management.<br></li><li>Visceral melee &amp; gunplay combat.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330260/extras/94bdd4267945a8851192900b84717a24.avif?t=1747400955\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330260/extras/88a4f64d7b1a317f711c9e5b16cf4c62.avif?t=1747400955\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOSS FIGHTS:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Be prepared to face CORR's vast roster of challenging multi-phase boss encounters.<br></li><li> Non-linear progression. Stuck on a boss fight? Try another for a while. <br></li><li> Tired of not being able to replay a boss fight you enjoyed? In CORR, all boss fights can be replayed through memory shards.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330260/extras/822d96949a43883d8e4824fb16380327.avif?t=1747400955\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER PROGRESSION:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Acquire talismans to customize your character build with passive abilities.<br></li><li> Acquire unique berserk powers that can be activated during combat. <br></li><li> Collect ingredients and brew your own consumables. <br></li><li> Obtain hexes that increase the game's difficulty in unique ways in order to challenge yourself and obtain unique rewards. <br></li><li> Level up your character's stats. </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330260/extras/84f73ce4ccc51ae4077528f88e4f71d7.avif?t=1747400955\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Piece together the events of the stagnant world by interpreting item descriptions, cryptic character dialogue, environmental storytelling, and more.<br></li><li>Includes branching NPC questlines. </li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "CORR is a CHALLENGING Souls-lite Boss Rush Action RPG where you Run-n-Gun &amp; Hack-n-Dash your way through formidable boss encounters. To endure the strange, dark, and bizarre world of CORR, level up and customize your warrior build with berserk powers, tonics, talismans, and more.                                                                                                    <br>                                                                                                          <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330260/extras/2cd4b129441ca92a4e485f279914c6f2.poster.avif?t=1747400955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330260/extras/2cd4b129441ca92a4e485f279914c6f2.webm?t=1747400955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330260/extras/2cd4b129441ca92a4e485f279914c6f2.mp4?t=1747400955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>I-frame dashes.<br></li><li>Stamina/energy management.<br></li><li>Visceral melee &amp; gunplay combat.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330260/extras/94bdd4267945a8851192900b84717a24.avif?t=1747400955\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330260/extras/88a4f64d7b1a317f711c9e5b16cf4c62.avif?t=1747400955\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOSS FIGHTS:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Be prepared to face CORR's vast roster of challenging multi-phase boss encounters.<br></li><li> Non-linear progression. Stuck on a boss fight? Try another for a while. <br></li><li> Tired of not being able to replay a boss fight you enjoyed? In CORR, all boss fights can be replayed through memory shards.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330260/extras/822d96949a43883d8e4824fb16380327.avif?t=1747400955\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER PROGRESSION:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Acquire talismans to customize your character build with passive abilities.<br></li><li> Acquire unique berserk powers that can be activated during combat. <br></li><li> Collect ingredients and brew your own consumables. <br></li><li> Obtain hexes that increase the game's difficulty in unique ways in order to challenge yourself and obtain unique rewards. <br></li><li> Level up your character's stats. </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330260/extras/84f73ce4ccc51ae4077528f88e4f71d7.avif?t=1747400955\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Piece together the events of the stagnant world by interpreting item descriptions, cryptic character dialogue, environmental storytelling, and more.<br></li><li>Includes branching NPC questlines. </li></ul>",
